 * Purpose: the Encore endpoint of @golden/service-channels's cross-app inbox: `POST /events/inbox`, raw.
 * Boundary: exposed outside session auth, since the signature authenticates the sender; the raw body reaches
 *           InboundEventsController (#stackra/inbox) untouched, through answerHttp.
 * Runtime: node
